<Text>4. THIS MODEL IS PART OF A PRODUCT DEFINITION DATASET IN ACCORDANCE WITH{BR}ASME Y14.41. UNLESS OTHERWISED SPECIFIED, BASIC DIMENSIONS SHALL BE OBTAINED{BR}DIRECTLY FROM THE MODEL. ALL FEATURES OF SIZE AND MINOR FEATURES ARE MODELED{BR}AT A NOMINAL (MEAN) VALUE, EXCEPT HOLES. HOLES ARE MODELED AT THE FIT CONDITION.{BR}</Text>
</Note>
