<XY>-0.0176379115569688 0.000538214252583921</XY>
</Text>
<Text>
<Data>WHERE SHOWN USING PERMANENT MARKER OR ETCHING IN THE FOLLOWING PATTERN:</Data>
<XY>-0.0185797720487513 -0.00108178574741608</XY>
</Text>
<Text>
<Data>"SERIAL NUMBER" OF 20</Data>
<XY>-0.0185797720487513 -0.00270178574741608</XY>
